#: b33e70b62a6d4fa4b79ca610689b6366 of
#: sds.advanced.count_min_sketch.CountMinSketch:3
msgid ""
"Maintains a ``depth × width`` matrix of integer counters. Each item is "
"hashed by *depth* independent hash functions; ``add(item)`` increments "
"one counter per row, and ``frequency(item)`` returns the minimum across "
"all *depth* counters — an upper bound on the true count."
msgstr ""

